{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 0,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "(Published in the Topeka Metro News on June 29, 2026)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 1,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "ORDINANCE NO. 20665"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 2,
      "style": null,
      "text": "AN ORDINANCE introduced by City Manager Dr. Robert M. Perez, removing"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 3,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "certain real property from the Capital City Townhomes TIF"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 4,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Redevelopment District."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 5,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Resolution No. 9796 approves the Capital City Townhomes project as"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 6,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "an eligible project under the Neighborhood Revitalization Program (“NRP”); and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the project property located is located in a Tax Increment Financing"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "style": null,
      "text": "district created by Ordinance No. 20651; and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 9,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, pursuant to Section 4f. of Resolution No. 9796 the property must be"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 10,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "removed from the TIF district; and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 11,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, K.S.A. 12-1771(g) authorizes the Governing Body to remove real"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 12,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "property from a redevelopment district; and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 13,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 14,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "CITY OF TOPEKA, KANSAS, that:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 15,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Section 1. The following properties are removed from the District:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 16,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "• 2020 SE Massachusetts Avenue"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 17,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "• 2021 SE Massachusetts Avenue"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 18,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "• 2023 SE Pennsylvania Street"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 19,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "• 2024 SE Massachusetts Avenue"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 20,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "• 2025 SE Massachusetts Avenue"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 21,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "• 2027 SE Pennsylvania Street"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 22,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "• 2029 SE Massachusetts Avenue"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 23,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "• 2033 SE Massachusetts Avenue"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 24,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Section 2. The City Clerk is directed to provide a copy of the Ordinance to the"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 25,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "County Clerk."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 26,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "Section 3. This Ordinance shall take effect and be in force from and after its"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 27,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "passage, approval and publication in the official city newspaper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 28,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "PASSED and APPROVED by the Governing Body June 16, 2026."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 29,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "ATTEST:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 30,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "CITY OF TOPEKA, KANSAS"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 31,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "______________________________________"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 32,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "Spencer L. Duncan, Mayor"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 33,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "_________________________"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 34,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "Brenda Younger, City Clerk"
    }
  ],
  "tables": []
}
